   array['On the whistle, each pair passes to each other through as many gates as possible in 45 seconds.', 'A pass through a gate to the partner on the other side scores 1 point. Not the same gate twice in a row.', 'Pairs count their score out loud together.', 'Rest for 1 minute, then go again and try to beat your own score.'],
   array['Easier: half the pairs go at a time so there is less traffic.', 'Harder: weaker foot only.', 'Ready for more: narrower gates and pair-against-pair challenges — the full Gates Competition Passing.'],
   array['Communicate — pick the gate together before moving', 'Sharp, firm passes — let the ball do the work', 'Head up to spot the next available gate'],
