('get-open-u8', 'Get Open (U8 Version)', '🏃', 'Passing', 'Beginner', 'U8', 10, 'Groups of 3', 'Two players move side to side to get open and pass through the middle, past a defender who can only walk.',
   array['Two players 8–10 yds apart, each moving along their own line', 'One defender in the middle, who may only walk', '1 ball per group', 'A cone in the middle so the defender can only block one side at a time'],
