('bumper-keepaway-u8', 'Bumper Keepaway (U8 Version)', '🔵', 'Possession', 'Beginner', 'U8', 12, '8–10', 'Keep-away with wide gates and a helper on each sideline: score by passing or dribbling through a gate.',
