   array['The two teams play keep-away inside the grid.', 'Score a point by passing through a gate to a teammate, or by dribbling through one.', 'The bumpers work along their sidelines and play for whichever team has the ball. Nobody tackles a bumper.', 'After a point, the same team keeps the ball and attacks a different gate.', 'Keep score. Rotate the bumpers every 2 minutes.'],
