   array['Blue and yellow play keep-away.', 'Red plays for whichever team has possession and can''t be tackled.', 'A team scores by completing a pass to a teammate through a gate.', 'After a point, play continues — attack a different gate next.', 'First to 3 wins. Then change the neutral team.'],
