('overload-scrimmage-u8', 'Overload Scrimmage (U8 Version)', '🔢', 'Scrimmage', 'Beginner', 'U8', 15, '6–8', 'Uneven-numbers game for young players: the bigger team keeps the ball and scores, the smaller team tries to win it and score the other way.',
