('long-passes-4-u10', 'Long Passes (4 People) (U10 Version)', '↔️', 'Passing', 'Beginner', 'U10', 15, 'Groups of 4', 'Passing over distance in fours: trap, lay off to the teammate beside you, and they pass it across — on the ground first, then lifted.',
