('across-the-river-u10', 'Across the River (U10 Version)', '🌊', 'Possession', 'Beginner', 'U10', 15, '8–10', 'Two-grid keep-away with a big overload: a team keeps the ball from one defender, who tries to win it and pass it across to teammates in the other grid.',
