('pierce-the-circle-u10', 'Pierce the Circle (U10 Version)', '🎯', 'Possession', 'Beginner', 'U10', 15, '9–11', 'A possession-and-vision game where both teams play around the outside of a big central circle, helped by a neutral player, and score by passing along the ground through the circle to a teammate on the other side.',
