   array['Perimeter Possession: Both teams operate entirely outside the circle in a continuous keep-away game.', 'Scoring: A team scores 1 point by completing a ground pass directly through the circle to a teammate on the opposite side.', 'Restricted Zone: Nobody may step inside the circle. Stepping inside, or the ball stopping inside, gives possession to the other team.', 'Touches: Three touches maximum, so players have time to find the lane.', 'Game Length: Play to 3 points, or 3-minute rounds.'],
   array['Easier: add a second neutral player.', 'Harder: take the neutral player out.', 'Ready for more: no neutral player and a smaller circle — the full Pierce the Circle.'],
